            "passed": true,
            "evidence": "The finding explains that both reads become LoadError::Io and run prints the same missing-file diagnostic for either failure, preventing operators from identifying which file to repair. It recommends attaching the configuration role and safe path at each read while preserving the original I/O source, without relying on a conversion-count threshold."
          }
        ]
